547 - Be Thou My Vision
 / 
Key: Eb
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 547
Topic: Christian Life - 

Verse 1:
[Eb/Bb]Be [Cm]Thou [Bb]my Vision, [Gm]OLord [Cm/G]of [Eb/Bb]my [Cm]heart;
[Fm]Naught be [Bb]all else to me, [Cm/Eb]save [Eb/Bb]that [Bb]Thou art
[Ab]Thou [Cm]my best Thought, by [Gm]day [Bb]or [Bb7/Ab]bynight,
[Cm/G]Waking [Gm]or sleeping, Thy presence [Cm/G]my [F7]light.

Verse 2:
[Eb/Bb]Be [Cm]Thou [Bb]my Wisdom, [Gm]and Thou [Cm/G]my [Eb/Bb]true [Cm]Word;
[Fm]I ever [Bb]with Thee and [Cm/Eb]Thou [Eb/Bb]with [Bb]me, Lord;
[Ab]Thou [Cm]my great Father, [Gm]I [Bb]Thy [Bb7/Ab]true [Cm/G]son;
[Cm/G]Thou [Gm]in me dwelling, and I with [Cm/G]Thee [F7]one.

Verse 3:
[Eb/Bb]Riches [Bb]I heed [Cm/G]not, [Gm]nor man's [Cm/G]empty praise,
[Fm]Thou mine [Bb]Inheritance, [Cm/Eb]now [Eb/Bb]and [Bb]always:
[Ab]Thou [Cm]and Thou only, [Gm]first [Bb]in [Bb7/Ab]my [Cm/G]heart,
[Cm/G]High [Gm]King of Heaven, my Treasure [Cm/G]Thou [F7]art.

Verse 4:
[Eb/Bb]High [Cm]King [Bb]of Heaven, [Gm]my victory [Cm]won,
[Fm]May I [Bb]reach Heaven's joys, [Cm/Eb]O [Bb]bright [Eb/Bb]Heaven's [Bb/F]Sun!
[Ab]Heart [Cm]of my own heart, [Gm]whatever [Bb7/Ab]befall,
[Cm/G]Still [Gm]be my Vision, O Ruler [Cm/G]of [F7]all.
